R2 visitor-thorp-52 own merits=["lasting"] label=Approved bd={"prosperity":8,"safety":0,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":10} causes=["prosperity"] ruler="Household Council" PARA="Mahesh Bhat, the boat-headman and Household Elder, holds the seat of the Household Council. The Household Council governs Radhawadi. Prosperity has earned the Household Council the approval of Radhawadi. Radhawadi has lasted for centuries, and its people count that in favour of the Household Council. Farms nearby have been abandoned after attacks. The community cannot agree on whether to shelter in place, build defences, or leave."
