R2 visitor-village-8 own merits=["weathered","lasting"] label=Endorsed bd={"prosperity":8,"safety":0,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":20} causes=["prosperity"] ruler="Elder Council" PARA="The Elder Council governs Albaminus. Its seat is held by Aurelia Brutus, the mine captain and Elder. Albaminus stands behind the Elder Council. Prosperity won it over. The Occupation is within living memory at Albaminus, and coming through it has left its people readier to stand by the Elder Council. Albaminus has also lasted for centuries, and that too counts for the Elder Council. A dispute over grazing rights and water access has run for two seasons, and the families on each side no longer speak to one another."
