R2 visitor-hamlet-139 own merits=["lasting"] label=Tolerated bd={"prosperity":15,"safety":-20,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":10} causes=["prosperity"] ruler="Elder Council" PARA="The Elder Council governs Kabahchihua. Its seat is held by Quetzalli Chel, the mine captain and Elder. Kabahchihua tolerates the Elder Council and no more. Crime is the reason. Kabahchihua has endured for generations, and its people give the Elder Council some of the credit. A dispute over field rotation and grazing rights has divided the village for most of this season."
R2 visitor-hamlet-139 shared merits=["lasting"] label=Tolerated bd={"prosperity":15,"safety":-20,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":10} causes=["prosperity"] ruler="Elder Council" PARA="Kabahchihua is governed by the Elder Council. Quetzalli Chel, the mine captain and Elder, holds its seat. Crime keeps Kabahchihua from more than tolerating the Elder Council. Kabahchihua has endured for generations, and its people give the Elder Council some of the credit. A dispute over field rotation and grazing rights has divided the village for most of this season."
