R2 visitor-hamlet-31 own merits=["weathered","lasting"] label=Approved bd={"prosperity":0,"safety":0,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":20} causes=[] ruler="Free Elder Council" PARA="Kilwood is governed by the Free Elder Council. Morrigan Lynch, the carpenter and Elder, holds its seat. Kilwood approves of the Free Elder Council. The Occupation is within living memory at Kilwood; the place came through it, and its people hold the more firmly to the Free Elder Council. Kilwood has also lasted for generations, and that too counts for the Free Elder Council. A dispute over grazing rights and water access has run for two seasons, and the families on each side no longer speak to one another."
