R2 visitor-hamlet-55 own merits=["lasting"] label=Approved bd={"prosperity":0,"safety":0,"defense":0,"food":0,"merits":10} causes=[] ruler="Headman's Authority" PARA="The Headman's Authority governs Bergstadt. Its seat is held by Norbert Bauer, the head shepherd and Headman. Bergstadt approves of the Headman's Authority. It has been here for generations, and people there are loath to see the Headman's Authority unsettled. The most devout households want a say over who may trade and when, and not everyone here agrees."
