C c-hxd-hamlet-39 serverPARA="Purevdulam Kereit, the quarry master and Elder, holds the seat of the Elder Council. The Elder Council governs Zuubash. Zuubash stands behind the Elder Council. The Occupation is only a few years past at Zuubash; the place came through it, and its people hold the more firmly to the Elder Council."
C c-hxd-hamlet-39 twinPARA="Purevdulam Kereit, the quarry master and Elder, holds the seat of the Elder Council. The Elder Council governs Zuubash. Zuubash stands behind the Elder Council. The Occupation is only a few years past at Zuubash; the place came through it, and its people hold the more firmly to the Elder Council."
C c-hxd-hamlet-39 ownPARA="Purevdulam Kereit, the quarry master and Elder, holds the seat of the Elder Council. The Elder Council governs Zuubash. Prosperity has won the Elder Council the backing of Zuubash. The Occupation is only a few years past at Zuubash; the place came through it, and its people hold the more firmly to the Elder Council. A dispute over grazing rights and water access has run for two seasons, and the families on each side no longer speak to one another."
